{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49735","headline":"临江仙 一 · 孙光宪","name":"临江仙 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"霜拍井梧乾叶堕，翠帏雕槛初寒。\n薄铅残黛称花冠，含情无语，延伫倚阑干。\n杳杳征轮何处去，离愁别恨千般。\n不堪心绪正多端，镜匳长掩，无意对孤鸾。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孙光宪","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_49735.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49735","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}